msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, sir. I'll take one <Color:7>Coral Love Necklace<Color:Default>, "
"please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "A Coral Love Necklace, is it? That'll be 3,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Oh my gosh! Who did you buy that necklace for? You're gonna\r\n"
"ask somebody to go steady, aren't you!? Is it Oyamada-senpai\r\n"
"from the track club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Hehehe... Maybe, maybe not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "It's the tutor, isn't it! I saw the way you've been stealing glances at him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Really!? Haruko, c'mon! Fill us in on the deets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Hee-hee! They say whoever has a special love coral will never be turned "
"down, so you're basically guaranteed a boyfriend!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Would you guys stop already!? Let's just go eat some burgers\r\n"
"and go home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(Those Coral Love Necklaces do seem pretty popular these days...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"How about a Coral Love Necklace for you, sir? Made with\r\n"
"genuine Okinawan coral. We've got plenty in stock, but they\r\n"
"won't last long!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "(Those must be the necklaces those high schoolers were talking about.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"In fact, it's been making big waves on the internet lately.\r\n"
"It's even considered something of a \"spiritual accessory.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"As you can see, this necklace is made from genuine, hermatypic coral "
"weathered to a fine sheen. This process helps the coral release beneficial "
"negative ions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Just keeping one of these special coral necklaces on your\r\n"
"person is said to bolster your luck in love and money, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"So what do you say? One Coral Love Necklace is going for the\r\n"
"incredibly reasonable price of 3,000 yen today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "No... I'm fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"I see. Well, if you change your mind, then you'd better act quick! 'Cause "
"these babies are selling like hotcakes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Okay, then I'll take one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Thank you, sir! Here's your precious Coral Love Necklace!\r\n"
"May it bring you only the best of fortune!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Coral Love Necklace<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"(...Is this thing really gonna make me lucky? I'll admit, I have my "
"doubts...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "(3,000 yen... Wait, I don't have enough cash on me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Sorry. I'll make sure to stop by again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "I see. Better hurry before they're all gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Buy a Coral Love Necklace"
msgstr ""

